### Title:
"Submit Application" button remains active after successful submission

### Description:
When a candidate submits an application, the success message appears but the button remains active.

### Environment:
Windows 11 / Chrome / iPhone iOS 18.7.1

### Preconditions:
User is logged in

### Steps to Reproduce:
1. Open vacancy page  
2. Click Submit Application  

### Actual Result:
Button remains clickable

### Expected Result:
Button should be disabled after submission
